    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "By using project plans and reporting tools, it is possible to manage the development and implementation of the commodity/service strategy. The UIG should work with the Commodity/Service Manager and complete a project report. The frequency of reporting may vary from organisation to organisation and project to project depending on issues such as:",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "The risk and complexity of the project",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "The structure and culture of the organisation",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Planning is a continual process and you should use lessons learned to inform your current and future plans.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Quickfire Guide",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Sign Off",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Sign Off"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Suggested review and sign off points are:",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Sign Off"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "At project initiation",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Sign Off"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "After initial opportunity assessment",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Sign Off"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "For approval of strategy including budget",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Sign Off"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "For approval of the procurement, Contract Notice, selection stage, SPD and/or ITT",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Sign Off"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "At contract award stage",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Sign Off"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "At implementation stage",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Sign Off"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Any review and agreement to the project plan should be subject to your organisation's governance arrangements.",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Sign Off"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "For high risk, business critical projects a more formal review process may be required. In simple terms, it is a review of an acquisition programme or procurement project carried out at a key decision point by a team of experienced people, independent of the project team.",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Sign Off"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    }
